pubspec.lock

# Android
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
android/key.properties
android/app/release/
# ⚠️ google-services.json IS committed. It carries no secret — the API key in
# it is a client identifier that ships inside every APK anyway, and Firebase
# gates writes on Auth/App Check rather than on it. Not committing it means a
# fresh checkout cannot build at all, which is the worse failure.
*.keystore
*.jks

